<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-STUTTGART CLAY-COURT QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STUTTGART CLAY-COURT QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results</p>
<p>in the $1 million Stuttgart clay-court tournament on Friday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat 12-Albert Berasategui (Spain) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>9-Albert Costa (Spain) beat 2-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) 6-4 6-4  </p>
<p>Matches postponed until Saturday:</p>
<p>Albert Portas (Spain) v 10-Felix Mantilla</p>
<p>4-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) v. Karol Kucera (Slovakia)</p>
</text>
